1
00:00:00,434 --> 00:00:01,869
Keep it out of the way.

2
00:00:01,909 --> 00:00:06,362
Hide the bar in some apps, while
you type, or until media plays.

3
00:00:07,628 --> 00:00:13,592
Open Visibility. In Gesture Volume,
under Advanced features, tap Visibility.

4
00:00:13,996 --> 00:00:15,531
Choose when it shows.

5
00:00:15,571 --> 00:00:19,766
Two switches: only while media
plays, or only during calls.

6
00:00:19,806 --> 00:00:22,417
Leave both off and it is always there.

7
00:00:22,726 --> 00:00:24,661
Pick what happens as you type.

8
00:00:24,701 --> 00:00:27,786
Move above the keyboard,
hide, or stay put.

9
00:00:27,826 --> 00:00:31,682
Moving, it can glide, spring
or bounce out of the way.

10
00:00:32,016 --> 00:00:33,651
Type in another app.

11
00:00:33,691 --> 00:00:37,126
In any app, as the keyboard comes
up the bar springs above it,

12
00:00:37,166 --> 00:00:39,260
and goes back when you are done.

13
00:00:40,991 --> 00:00:42,576
Pick apps to hide it in.

14
00:00:42,616 --> 00:00:47,438
Back in Visibility, tick the apps where
it should step aside. Here, Video.

15
00:00:49,423 --> 00:00:51,293
There, it steps aside.

16
00:00:51,333 --> 00:00:53,483
Open Video and the bar is gone.

17
00:00:53,523 --> 00:00:55,808
Leave it, and the bar is back.

18
00:00:56,644 --> 00:00:58,404
Show it on the lock screen.

19
00:00:58,444 --> 00:01:01,679
Turn on Show on the lock screen
and the bar is there too,

20
00:01:01,719 --> 00:01:04,020
for volume and quick toggles.

21
00:01:06,648 --> 00:01:09,713
That is the whole series.
Thanks for watching.
